      "day": 0,
      "dayMask": 0,
      "description": "<p><span class=\"event-name\">The Rick Burgess Show</span><span class=\"event-name presents up\">Are You Ready Live Tour</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"entry-content\">\r\n<p><strong><em>The Are You Ready Tour</em> </strong>isn’t just another show; it’s a live celebration of everything you love about<strong> The Rick Burgess Show.</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><em>The Are You Ready Tour</em> </strong>brings<strong> The Rick Burgess Show </strong>live to the stage for an interactive, high-energy experience you won’t hear on the radio. From stand-up comedy and live audience interaction to contests, prizes, and a no-holds-barred Q&amp;A, every stop on the tour is packed with surprises.</p>\r\n<p>And if you think you know the music, think again! Get ready to rock with <strong>Mr. Lucky, </strong>famously known among fans as the <strong>“World’s Greatest Garage Band.”</strong> This legendary Alabama group—formed by Rick and longtime friends back in the ’90s—helped define the show’s signature sound and earned that fan-given title with performances and memories that still get talked about today. For the first time since 2003, Mr. Lucky is back on stage, making this a truly once-in-a-generation moment for longtime listeners.</p>\r\n</div>",
