      "day": 0,
      "dayMask": 0,
      "description": "<p>Ladies! New to Montgomery, Retired, or just ready to Meet New Friends? <br>You don't have to be \"new\" to be a Newcomer!<br>Join us for our FREE \"Get Acquainted Coffee\" to meet members and hear about our fun activities. We have Book Club, Mah Jongg, Arts &amp; Crafts, Movie Mavens, Cooking Club and more!<br>This is a relaxed, come-as-you-are gathering where you can learn about our 12 activity groups, year-round social events, and monthly luncheons at Arrowhead Country Club.<br>Annual dues is just $25 if you decide to join.<br>Drop in at 10am, or feel free to RSVP or ask questions at newcomersmontgomery@gmail.com We’d love to meet you!</p>",
